  "body_html": "<h1>Strict Equilibrium</h1>\n<p>A profile $s\\in S$ is a strict equilibrium if\n$$\n  \\{s\\}=BR(s).\n$$\nEquivalently, every player's prescribed strategy is the unique best response to\nthe other players' prescribed strategies.</p>",
